<title>GREECE: BANCO POPULAR EQUADOR'S HALDEOS JOINS NATWEST, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>BANCO POPULAR EQUADOR'S HALDEOS JOINS NATWEST, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plato Haldeos, formerly an options trader on Latin American equities with Banco Popular de Equador in Miami, U.S.A, has joined the swaps desk of NatWest, Athens.</p>
<p>Haldeos who holds an MBA degree from the University of Chicago had been an options trader for the Miami-based hedge fund for two years prior to joining NatWest, Athens. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
